{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7efdb30184780d858ec28e90a56052366d5c1f8f075095d5c4714fbb7e6f047e","ja":"難関トークテーマ！？","zh":"棘手的聊天主题！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5e9734237f137286789dade9bf54511de198f12964f5ce9b0bc923321f04899a","ja":"紬と歌織に、音楽番組の出演依頼があった。\nさっそくその打ち合わせが進められていて……","zh":"紬和歌织收到了音乐节目的出演邀请。\n很快便推进起了相关的事前商谈……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c87492bf7cc2cc6a6cf6eb0301435eb6f772d52d366d3b2fe2862f3ce11d10d8","ja":"こちらのステージで、トークをしてから\n歌うんですね。はい、流れはわかりました！","zh":"是在这个舞台上先聊天，\n然后再唱歌对吧。好的，流程我已经明白了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e69142dec77a167bd201b38c0d86cdbed82719f06dc64d894b181320e1b310db","ja":"トークテーマも決まっているのですね。\n『デュオなら息ぴったり！？クエスチョン』……？","zh":"访谈主题也已经定下来了呢。\n“是双人组合就该默契十足！？快问快答”……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0cec492828927589a6f982c78ae3c3fea9cf594c12fb3287ed2f2b0341594d5b","ja":"なるほど……質問に対して、\n私たちの回答が一致すれば良いのですね。","zh":"原来如此……也就是说针对提问，\n只要我们的回答一致就可以了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"56d872a8be35cef7e980dfbb91934ec2941a4993b6478f3a96beb03dc803d6f2","ja":"「せっかくなので今から試しにやってみましょう！\nずばり、休日の過ごし方は？」","zh":"「机会难得，现在就来试着做做看吧！\n直截了当地问，你休息日都是怎么度过的？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a156e12c4b4e4a185c54f151c067d65d7ad8b1f03a096211fd109f491a60122f","ja":"私はよく『ドライブ』をします。\n運転が好きですし、気分転換にもいいですから。","zh":"我经常会去“兜风”。\n因为不仅喜欢开车，而且也很适合转换心情。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5ae6e05725965eeaaa45892767f7ab5f0a549df21180c1f4e2673710982b0915","ja":"私は『庭園巡り』など……。\n美しい景色を見ていると心が洗われるようです。","zh":"我喜欢“庭园漫步”之类的……\n看着美丽的景色，心灵仿佛得到了洗涤。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"236eb711d6d00db4f1ce2b38d04e11e7b73e6572a03955aaee0bc0aec66f658f","ja":"「なるほど！　じゃあどんどん行きましょう！\n今食べたいものは和食・洋食・中華のどれ！」","zh":"「原来如此！那咱们继续接招吧！\n现在最想吃的是日料、西餐还是中餐中的哪种！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4d6fd48227d3af9ee0cd85a8e74f86d709fa486eb8eea683724172bd1f871e1b","ja":"そうですね、今は……『洋食』でしょうか。\n美味しいホテルランチのことを思い出して。","zh":"让我想想，现在的话……选“西餐”吧。\n我想起了美味的酒店午餐。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3ecc4fbc6f4cd9357fb1c8ec69fbf997e73b481c00ae1bd618dab16993afbbeb","ja":"私は『和食』を食べたいと……。\nま、またちがう答えに！","zh":"我想吃的是“日料”……\n又、又出现不同的答案了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f3c2c8b91048b66d6bdcc07b0814b3cc9a9fbb8f4954a6491d389f1dcecbfa1f","ja":"紬ちゃん、お疲れさま♪\nふふ、なんだかあのクイズ難しかったわね。","zh":"小紬，辛苦啦♪\n呵呵，总觉得那个猜谜还挺难的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9fd421ae70e3ae03bced5c5625d0c2caf2165017145735649bd71725e18c3f0b","ja":"結局、5問全部、\nバラバラの答えになってしまって。","zh":"结果，5道题的答案\n全都各不相同。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"37a17baebfeadb0786305be1922ba91b6b81b4c45c084efa9c043e583cc414bb","ja":"はい……あの、このままでは、視聴者のみなさんに\n仲の悪いデュオと思われてしまわないでしょうか？","zh":"好的……那个，这样下去的话，观众朋友们\n会不会觉得我们是一个关系很差的双人组合啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b77d9f9d1a65a4b162d575ad113d967d6a2efc780a9c003aa8f81a562670afbb","ja":"えっ？　そ、そうかしら……！？\nそんなに気にしなくてもいい気がするけど……。","zh":"诶？是、是这样吗……！？\n我觉得倒也不用那么在意的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1245.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"f9676b0a41f04b2b5a029a9c7f5ff02fc0838193b46a6a1354400c76ea1035cc","ja":"いいえ、やはりデュオとしては答えが合うように\nするべきです。それでぜひ、お願いしたいことが……。","zh":"不，作为双人组合，还是应该\n让答案统一才对。所以无论如何，有一件事想拜托您……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
